title(2,'Encryption kaise chalti hai?','Pehle session banti hai, phir har message encrypt/decrypt hota hai.')
h('Step 1: keys establish karna')
p('<b>1.</b> Angular temporary P-256 public/private key pair banata hai. Public key <b>POST /api/crypto/session</b> ko bhejta hai. Private key browser mein rehti hai.')
p('<b>2.</b> API apna temporary pair banati hai. Dono public keys se ECDH shared secret derive hota hai. API public key, random salt, session ID aur expiry return karti hai.')
p('<b>3.</b> Dono sides HKDF-SHA256 se do alag AES-256 keys derive karti hain: request ke liye ek, response ke liye ek. AES keys network par send nahi hoti. Crypto session 10 minutes valid hai.')
h('Step 2: encrypted round trip')
p('<b>4.</b> Angular JSON ko bytes mein badalta hai, fresh 12-byte nonce banata hai, phir AES-GCM encrypt karta hai. Result ciphertext aur 16-byte tag hai.')
p('<b>5.</b> Gateway envelope forward karta hai. API tag verify karke decrypt karti hai. Verification fail hui toh business handler run nahi hota.')
p('<b>6.</b> API business result ko response key aur fresh nonce se encrypt karti hai. Angular matching request ID check karta hai, tag verify karta hai, phir response decrypt karta hai.')
table(['Term','Simple matlab'],[['Ciphertext','Original JSON ka encrypted form.'],['Nonce / IV','Har encryption ka fresh random 12-byte value. Same key ke saath reuse mat karo.'],['Tag','Authentication check: data ya bound metadata badli toh decrypt fail hota hai.'],['AAD','Visible metadata jo tag se protect hoti hai: session ID, request ID, POST, route aur direction.'],['Base64','Bytes ko JSON mein carry karne ka encoding format. Ye encryption nahi hai.']],[110,375])
h('Wire par kya dikhega?')
code('{ "sessionId": "...", "requestId": "...",\n  "nonce": "Base64...", "ciphertext": "Base64...",\n  "tag": "Base64..." }')
p('Session/request IDs aur route visible hain. JSON body encrypted hai. Session bootstrap aur health plaintext hain; isliye HTTPS bhi zaroori hai. Web Crypto tag ciphertext ke end mein deta hai; client usko split karta hai, kyunki .NET AesGcm separate tag leta hai.')
nextpage()

title(3,'Register se logout tak','Crypto session data protect karti hai. Login token user ki identity verify karta hai.')
h('Register')
p('Form name/email/password leta hai. AuthService encrypted transport call karta hai. API decrypt karke validation karti hai; email lowercase normalize hota hai. PasswordHasher salted password hash banata hai. Plain password store nahi hota. Registration ke baad user ko login karna hota hai.')
h('Login')
p('API password hash verify karti hai. Success par random 256-bit opaque token banta hai. Ye JWT nahi hai. Token encrypted response mein aata hai; Angular service memory mein rakhti hai. API token ka SHA-256 lookup hash store karti hai. Login 30 minutes valid hai.')
h('Profile aur logout')
p('Profile request ke encrypted JSON mein token jaata hai. API independently token validate karke sirf id/name/email return karti hai. Logout token record remove karta hai; us token se future profile request reject hoti hai. Route guard sirf navigation help hai; actual protection API mein hai.')
table(['POST route','Decrypted request','Application result'],[['/api/auth/register','name, email, password','ok, message, user'],['/api/auth/login','email, password','ok, message, user, token'],['/api/auth/me','token','ok, message, user'],['/api/auth/logout','token','ok, message']],[160,150,175])
p('<b>Public routes:</b> GET /api/health; POST /api/crypto/session. <b>Demo route:</b> POST /api/secure/echo encrypted payload receive karke echo karta hai.')
h('Response samajhne ka rule')
p('Valid encrypted request ka business result HTTP 200 ke andar encrypted aata hai. Wrong password bhi decrypted <b>ok: false</b> deta hai. Sirf HTTP 200 dekhkar login successful mat samjho. Invalid encrypted envelope jaise protocol errors plaintext HTTP 400/409 ho sakte hain.')
h('Abhi data kahan hai?')
p('API: users, salted hashes, token hashes aur crypto sessions memory mein. Angular: login token aur AES keys memory mein. localStorage, sessionStorage aur cookies use nahi hote. Auth credentials/tokens lab ke debug panels mein nahi dikhte.')
nextpage()

