nextpage()

title(5,'Future change kahan karna hai?','Example: baad mein encrypted Update Profile feature add karna ho.')
h('Naya encrypted endpoint add karne ka recipe')
p('<b>1. Contract:</b> Route decide karo, jaise POST /api/profile/update. Decrypted request mein token aur new name ho; response mein ok/message/user ho. Pehle exact field names decide karo.')
p('<b>2. Backend logic:</b> Profile service mein token validate karo, name validate karo, phir data update karo. Encryption session ko login proof mat samjho.')
p('<b>3. API route:</b> Demo.Api/Program.cs mein route map karo. SessionStore.Process(envelope, exactRoute, handler) se decrypted JSON handler tak aur result encrypted response tak pahunchao.')
p('<b>4. Gateway:</b> Demo.Gateway/Program.cs ki allowed-route list mein same POST path add karo. Ye step miss hua toh gateway 404 dega.')
p('<b>5. Angular:</b> AuthService mein transport.post(exactRoute, payload) use karo. Form/component aur zarurat ho toh app.routes.ts mein page add karo. Token ko auth service ke andar rakho.')
p('<b>6. Verification:</b> Build aur integration checks run karo. Valid update, invalid token, validation failure, tampering aur replay cover karo. Phir module ka Git commit/push karo.')
h('Common changes ka shortcut')
table(['Change','Files / attention'],[['Colors, form layout, labels','auth-page.html/css; app.html/css; lab.html/css.'],['New register field','Form + AuthService payload + Credentials/validation + public response + tests.'],['API port change','API Properties/launchSettings.json + gateway ApiBaseUrl setting.'],['Gateway port change','Gateway launchSettings.json + client proxy.conf.json.'],['Crypto session expiry','SessionStore.Create: AddMinutes(10). Client renewal/expiry behavior recheck karo.'],['Login expiry / password policy','AuthStore: AddMinutes(30), validation; Angular form/help text aur tests update karo.'],['Database add karna','AuthStore users dictionary ko persistent repository se replace karo. Password hashes hi save karo; token expiry/revocation preserve karo.']],[160,325])
p('<b>Crypto rule:</b> AAD ka method/path/direction, HKDF labels, key length ya envelope format change karo toh Angular aur .NET dono update karo. Known interoperability/tamper tests dobara run karo.')
nextpage()

